# OpenWeatherMap API Key
# 1. Get your free API key from: https://openweathermap.org/api
# 2. Sign up → Go to "API Keys" section → Copy your key
# 3. Rename this file to .env and paste your key below
# Note: It may take 10-15 minutes for the key to activate after signup

VITE_OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
